es), so it is building capacity for future growth."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.3%), and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Shareholder yield is a modest 1.1% (2.5% in dividends, less 1.1% of net share issuance).","The share count has grown 3.1% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It has paid a dividend for 40 consecutive years, raising it 6.5% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 2,174 employees, each generates about $834K of revenue, 0.8x the Utilities median, and revenue has grown 3.8% a year across its filed history.","Free cash flow is negative, at -$266K per employee.","CEO pay is $2.9M (3x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":20,"head":"Avoid: priced 47% above its fair value of $99.37.","pros":[],"cons":["Trades 47% above fair value of $99.37","ROIC 5.6% vs WACC 6.3%","FCF margin 31.9% (burns cash)","Net debt/EBITDA 5.3x","Interest coverage only 2.1x"],"flags":["Priced 47% above its fair value of $99.37","Earns below its cost of capital and burns cash"],"need":[],"buy_below":84.47,"vc":{"base":99.37,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":99.37,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.0119,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":20.2834,"ev_ebitda":12.5675,"pfcf":19.9631,"pb":1.8172,"roic":0.0568,"gross_margin":0.3591,"fcf_margin":-0.0633,"div_yield":0.0325}},"ticker":"IDA","date":"2026-11-13"}